  "prefLabel": "Den 101.19 Licensure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Den 101.19 “Licensure” means the process by which the board, to protect the public, grants written permission to persons meeting qualifications set forth in these rules to engage in the practice of dentistry or dental hygiene.\n\nSource. #7969, eff 10-10-03; renumbered by #12427 (formerly Den 101.13); renumbered by #14140 (formerly Den 101.16)",
